function TH([string]$s){$x=[Security.Cryptography.SHA256]::Create();try{([BitConverter]::ToString($x.ComputeHash($Utf8NoBom.GetBytes($s))).Replace('-','').ToLowerInvariant())}finally{$x.Dispose()}}
function C([string]$r,[string]$rel,[bool]$must=$true){$rf=[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($r).TrimEnd('\');$p=[IO.Path]::GetFullPath((Join-Path $rf ($rel.Replace('/','\'))));A ($p.StartsWith($rf+'\',[StringComparison]::OrdinalIgnoreCase)) "path escapes root: $rel";if($must){A (Test-Path -LiteralPath $p -PathType Leaf) "missing: $p"};$p}
function FA([string]$r,[object[]]$m){$parts=foreach($e in($m|Sort-Object relative_path)){[string]$e.relative_path+'|'+(Get-HashValue(C $r ([string]$e.relative_path)))};TH($parts-join[char]10)}
function PA([string]$r,[object[]]$m){$parts=[Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new();foreach($e in($m|Sort-Object relative_path)){A ($e.in_aggregate -in @('true','false')) "bad in_aggregate: $($e.relative_path)";$p=C $r ([string]$e.relative_path);A ((Get-HashValue $p)-ceq[string]$e.sha256) "member hash differs: $($e.relative_path)";A ((Get-Item -LiteralPath $p).Length-eq[int64]$e.bytes) "member bytes differ: $($e.relative_path)";if($e.in_aggregate-ceq 'true'){$parts.Add([string]$e.relative_path+'|'+[string]$e.sha256+'|'+[string]$e.bytes)}};TH($parts.ToArray()-join[char]10)}
